### extra/unknown fields are stripped or forced server-side -> 201, visibility is "private" and status is "pending" regardless of the injected values, createdById is the caller (2) not the spoofed one
POST http://localhost:3000/polls/new HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
x-user-id: 2

{
	"title": "cannot self-elevate",
	"type": "multiple_choice",
	"endsAt": "2026-12-31T23:59:59.000Z",
	"visibility": "public",
	"allowChangeVote": true,
	"isAnonymous": false,
	"status": "active",
	"createdById": 999,
	"id": 1,
	"options": [
		{ "text": "A", "order": 0 },
		{ "text": "B", "order": 1 }
	]
}
